sequenceDiagram
    actor U
    participant S as Service
    U->>+S: request
    S->>+S: validate
    S->>+S: deep check
    S-->>-S: deep ok
    loop retry
        alt connect
            S->>U: progress
        else timeout
            Note right of S: give up after three attempts total
        end
    end
    S-->>-S: validated
    S-->>-U: done
    opt when failed
        S->>U: abort
    end
